From 7d72f2d1d627cefeb234afb67bbced861acb5628 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Langsdorff <131063968+clangsdorff@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Fri, 13 Nov 2026 19:49:24 +0300
Subject: [PATCH 46/46] SystemUI: add support for advanced restart options

port lineageos advanced restart submenu to the power menu, gated by
Settings.Secure.ADVANCED_REBOOT and hidden while keyguard is locked or
for secondary users. adds recovery, bootloader, fastboot and download
reboot targets along with localized strings.
